hat model was first produced, it was top-of-the-line. For five years, it was an enemy to be feared.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_06_e_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_06_e_21","text":"In fact, they were so lethal that many considered them the deadliest Raptures ever produced.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_06_e_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_06_e_22","text":"However, humans discovered a critical flaw in them. If you maintained a distance of 100-150m and attacked from a certain direction, they were rendered defenseless.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_06_e_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_06_e_23","text":"What was once a terrifying model soon became one that was very easy to deal with. Before long, the production of those Raptures ceased.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_06_e_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_06_e_24","text":"Okay, so it used to be the hot new thing in the past, but it's yesterday's news now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_06_e_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_06_e_25","text":"What of it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_06_e_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_06_e_26","text":"In that encounter back there, I attempted to take advantage of their weakness,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_06_e_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_06_e_27","text":"but nothing happened.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_06_e_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_06_e_28","text":"Are you saying it's an improved model?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_06_e_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_06_e_29","text":"No. Once a Rapture model ceases production, it's never brought back.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_06_e_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_06_e_30","text":"Then what is it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_06_e_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_06_e_31","text":"I'm not sure, but I think it's safe to say the Gatekeeper may have something to do with it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_06_e_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_06_e_32","text":"You mean the Gatekeeper is capable of producing entirely new Raptures?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_06_e_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_06_e_33","text":"In the worst-case scenario, potentially.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_06_e_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_06_e_34","text":"No way, that can't be possible.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_06_e_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_06_e_35","text":"No more impossible than the Devil Hunters materializing out of thin air.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_06_e_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_06_e_36","text":"True.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce_01_06_e_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce_01_06_e_37","text":"Let's keep moving. We have a better chance of understanding this once we locate the research materials.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}